                                                "sense_id": "2087d9a6-57c1-3ce5-acb8-94ca52759c9a",
                                                "text": "when my name and honor ſhall be ſpread,\nAs far as Boreas claps his braſen wings,\nOr faire Botëes ſends his cheerefull light."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e2e1d7a-fdc4-48f3-b2b7-9b824dc126fe",
                                                "sense_id": "2087d9a6-57c1-3ce5-acb8-94ca52759c9a",
                                                "text": "These fringes of lamplight, struggling up through smoke and thousandfold exhalation, some fathoms into the ancient reign of Night, what thinks Boötes of them, as he leads his Hunting-Dogs over the Zenith in their leash of sidereal fire?"
                                            }
